%N A126750 Number of 2-connected (or biconnected) graphs on n nodes with chromatic number 2.
%C A126750 Equally, number of 2-connected (or biconnected) bipartite graphs on n nodes.
%C A126750 Also number of biconnected triangle-free graphs on n nodes with chromatic number 2, since chromatic number 2 implies triangle-free. - _Gordon Royle_, Apr 11 2007
%C A126750 See the Gainer-Dewar/Gessel reference for formulas and SageMath code. - _Ralf Stephan_, May 18 2013
